    "background_story": "Amalia was a shy and introverted singer who had always dreamed of performing on stage. Despite her passion, she struggled with stage fright, her voice quavering with every note. She would often practice in front of her mirror, trying to calm her nerves, but the fear of being judged by others held her back. One day, a local music teacher, Mrs. Jenkins, discovered Amalia's talent and took her under her wing. With gentle guidance and encouragement, Amalia began to overcome her fears. She started performing at small gatherings and eventually worked up the courage to audition for the school choir. Though her voice still quavered at times, Amalia's determination and love for music shone through, earning her a spot in the choir and a newfound confidence that would stay with her forever.",
